      "start_seconds": 5.16,
      "end_seconds": 10.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.26,
      "end_seconds": 12.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.47,
      "end_seconds": 25.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "yeah, it's burning in both feet i don't know what's causing it i'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.68,
      "end_seconds": 30.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.64,
      "end_seconds": 33.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.8,
      "end_seconds": 34.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.64,
      "end_seconds": 40.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I, I take paracetamol, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.91,
      "end_seconds": 44.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.02,
      "end_seconds": 50.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "500 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.8,
      "end_seconds": 55.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.45,
      "end_seconds": 62.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Two months now. Before this I was on omeprazole; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.04,
      "end_seconds": 83.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.43,
      "end_seconds": 90.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Around two months... no wait, you know, it's more like six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.84,
      "end_seconds": 94.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.05,
      "end_seconds": 104.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "honestly, all the time there was pins and needles in the legs, yes, but that went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.28,
      "end_seconds": 109.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "And what about hand symptoms or foot ulcers?"
